happening over there,

00:57:34.551 --> 00:57:35.919
where they don't really
understand human nature.

00:57:35.919 --> 00:57:37.287 align:start size:84% position:16%
- I didn't say over
there, it's all of us.

00:57:37.287 --> 00:57:39.122
- Okay, so now that I
want you to do then,

00:57:39.122 --> 00:57:40.356
so give me some of
that on the right.

00:57:40.356 --> 00:57:41.791
- It's all of us.

00:57:41.791 --> 00:57:43.293 align:start size:94% position:6%
- Is there something
maybe that I'm not seeing

00:57:43.293 --> 00:57:44.427
that's more broadly happening
on the right or what's the-

00:57:44.427 --> 00:57:46.763 align:start size:88% position:13%
- I see the same
excesses on both sides.

00:57:46.763 --> 00:57:49.065 align:start size:97% position:3%
It's just that one right now
is sort of more in charge

00:57:49.065 --> 00:57:52.836
and more sort of involved
with our everyday life.

00:57:52.836 --> 00:57:54.270
You know what I mean?

00:57:54.270 --> 00:57:55.438 align:start size:94% position:6%
We're having interactions,
people are yelling.

00:57:55.438 --> 00:57:57.373 align:start size:88% position:13%
I've walked by somebody,
I ran by somebody,

00:57:57.373 --> 00:57:58.641
when I wasn't wearing a mask,

00:57:58.641 --> 00:58:00.743
I was out running and
the guy was like, "Ah!"

00:58:00.743 --> 00:58:02.345
Like that's that kind of thing,

00:58:02.345 --> 00:58:03.746
I don't see that stuff
from the right. (laughs)

00:58:03.746 --> 00:58:04.981 align:start size:97% position:3%
I don't see the signals, but-
- Right,

00:58:04.981 --> 00:58:06.449
so what am I not
seeing there then,

00:58:06.449 --> 00:58:08.585
if it is, I get it, they
have more culture power now

00:58:08.585 --> 00:58:09.853
So it feels louder now.

00:58:09.853 --> 00:58:11.588
- I wondered that
same thing myself,

00:58:11.588 --> 00:58:13.857
what am I not seeing that,

00:58:13.857 --> 00:58:16.960 align:start size:84% position:16%
I would say, usually
on the right,

00:58:16.960 --> 00:58:18.228
rigidity is more of the problem

00:58:18.228 --> 00:58:20.463 align:start size:84% position:16%
and there's more
openness on the left

00:58:20.463 --> 00:58:22.398
and more rigidity on the right.

00:58:22.398 --> 00:58:26.769
And the rigidity can
go towards excess.

00:58:26.769 --> 00:58:30.573
I've seen some of our
friends say things

00:58:30.573 --> 00:58:33.543
where I get the same, my
butt muscles tighten up,

00:58:33.543 --> 00:58:34.777
in a similar fashion,

00:58:34.777 --> 00:58:36.412
like, I don't think
you really mean that.

00:58:36.412 --> 00:58:37.614
And I don't say anything,

00:58:37.614 --> 00:58:39.516 align:start size:84% position:16%
I don't say anything
to them either,

00:58:39.516 --> 00:58:42.418
about their early treatments

00:58:42.418 --> 00:58:45.755 align:start size:97% position:3%
or what they're thinking
about the virus, or vaccines,

00:58:45.755 --> 00:58:47.223
or anything like that.

00:58:47.223 --> 00:58:48.725
It's like, you're entitled
to your opinion, that's fine.

00:58:48.725 --> 00:58:51.528
If you want me, talk to me,
I'm available, kind of thing.

00:58:51.528 --> 00:58:54.130
- Right, I guess for me, the
fundamental difference would be

00:58:54.130 --> 00:58:56.099
that for whatever
rigidity is there.

00:58:56.099 --> 00:58:58.902
And of course it is, if you're
more conservative by nature,

00:58:58.902 --> 00:59:01.070
you're less in to change, okay.

00:59:01.070 --> 00:59:03.339
But to me, it's like in
a time when the world

00:59:03.339 --> 00:59:05.842 align:start size:97% position:3%
is just spinning off the cliff
because of this craziness-

00:59:05.842 --> 00:59:06.776
- But it makes them more rigid.

00:59:06.776 --> 00:59:08.044
- A little rigidity's okay,

00:59:08.044 --> 00:59:09.479
and it makes them
more rigid, yeah.

00:59:09.479 --> 00:59:11.447 align:start size:97% position:3%
- No, I agree a little
rigidity is, I'm up for it,

00:59:11.447 --> 00:59:15.351
but the virginity can
have a problem too.

00:59:15.351 --> 00:59:20.356
And I think that in
there creates some
of the funny thinking

00:59:21.791 --> 00:59:24.661
and there's a, what is it
over there that bothers me,

00:59:24.661 --> 00:59:26.996 align:start size:97% position:3%
that could get out of
control, it might, my fear is-

00:59:26.996 --> 00:59:28.698 align:start size:84% position:16%
- I try to find it,
I'm trying to find it.

00:59:28.698 --> 00:59:29.899
- Yeah, yeah, we should
keep an eye out for it.

00:59:29.899 --> 00:59:31.301 align:start size:84% position:16%
- That's why I'm
asking the question.

00:59:31.301 --> 00:59:33.169 align:start position:0%
- Because, you know why,
everyone's in hiding right now.

00:59:33.169 --> 00:59:35.672 align:start size:84% position:16%
So we really, I
see glimpses of it.

00:59:35.672 --> 00:59:38.007 align:start size:94% position:6%
It pops out at parties
and things where somebody,

00:59:38.007 --> 00:59:40.276
where everyone just
goes, okay. (laughs)

00:59:40.276 --> 00:59:42.745
And I'm thinking, where does
that go when it gets to be,

00:59:42.745 --> 00:59:47.250 align:start size:88% position:13%
I think my fear is
there'll be retribution

00:59:47.250 --> 00:59:49.986
and guillotines on that
side too, that's my fear.

00:59:49.986 --> 00:59:52.889
So if the right can not do that

00:59:52.889 --> 00:59:55.458 align:start size:88% position:13%
and stay focused on
some pragmatic solutions

00:59:55.458 --> 00:59:59.062 align:start size:97% position:3%
and staying positive and
getting everybody on the ship,

00:59:59.062 --> 01:00:01.464
it will be much to
everyone's advantage.

01:00:01.464 --> 01:00:03.800 align:start size:97% position:3%
The problem is the pendulum
seems to go both ways

01:00:03.800 --> 01:00:05.268
and I'm fearful that,

01:00:05.268 --> 01:00:08.371 align:start size:97% position:3%
and the same processes are
going on there that elsewhere,

01:00:08.371 --> 01:00:12.208 align:start size:94% position:6%
it's just different
themes, different themes.

01:00:12.208 --> 01:00:15.011
It's very concerning, I'm
very worried about it,

01:00:15.011 --> 01:00:18.014 align:start size:88% position:13%
but I remain optimistic
and that's just me,

01:00:18.014 --> 01:00:20.249 align:start size:97% position:3%
I'm always optimistic about
people, I love people.

01:00:20.249 --> 01:00:22.118 align:start size:84% position:16%
And I feel like
especially Americans,

01:00:22.118 --> 01:00:25.021
my big push would
be to try to get us

01:00:25.021 --> 01:00:29.626
under the umbrella of
what got us all here

01:00:29.626 --> 01:00:32.228 align:start size:97% position:3%
in the first place, why
did my ancestors come here?

01:00:32.228 --> 01:00:34.897
Why did my family run away

01:00:34.897 --> 01:00:37.033
from the Ukrainian
genocide, thank God.

01:00:37.033 --> 01:00:41.337 align:start size:97% position:3%
Why did they avoid the
Bolsheviks and the czarists,

01:00:41.337 --> 01:00:43.840
all three were getting
on my family's case.

01:00:43.840 --> 01:00:48.645 align:start position:0%
And by the way, I'm called
anti-immigrant, again, fuck you.

01:00:49.912 --> 01:00:52.215
Because my family
escaped a genocide,

01:00:52.215 --> 01:00:55.184
one of the ones you guys
have all forgotten about.

01:00:55.184 --> 01:00:59.489
So they came here
because of an idea,

01:00:59.489 --> 01:01:02.125
and we have to get clear
about that idea again,

01:01:02.125 --> 01:01:03.593 align:start size:84% position:16%
and we have to value
that idea again,

01:01:03.593 --> 01:01:05.328 align:start size:94% position:6%
I feel like that's what's
under attack really,

01:01:05.328 --> 01:01:06.829
when you get right down to it,

01:01:06.829 --> 01:01:10.199
that the principles and the
idea that those geniuses,

01:01:10.199 --> 01:01:12.235
yes, they were old white men,
there were some slave owners,

01:01:12.235 --> 01:01:14.037
and there were some
horrible things.

01:01:14.037 --> 01:01:15.772
Hamilton was a screw ball,

01:01:15.772 --> 01:01:20.777 align:start size:97% position:3%
but there was a extraordinary
set of ideas put forth

01:01:22.645 --> 01:01:25.148 align:start size:84% position:16%
at that time that
have been the umbrella

01:01:25.148 --> 01:01:28.918 align:start size:97% position:3%
for multiple generations of
humans, from multiple regions,

01:01:28.918 --> 01:01:31.621
every region of the world,
and multiple ethnicities

01:01:31.621 --> 01:01:36.626
to get along it to an uncanny
degree and lead good lives.

01:01:37.994 --> 01:01:39.562 align:start size:94% position:6%
If we could just get
back to that, the basics,

01:01:39.562 --> 01:01:41.464
and I'm not saying
brainwash everybody

01:01:41.464 --> 01:01:43.466
and stand up and pledge
allegiance every day.

01:01:43.466 --> 01:01:44.734
I'm not saying that,

01:01:44.734 --> 01:01:46.569
just expose everybody
to those good ideas

01:01:46.569 --> 01:01:48.037 align:start size:81% position:19%
and agree that
they're good ideas

01:01:48.037 --> 01:01:50.573
and see if we can live
under those principles.

01:01:50.573 --> 01:01:51.841
